@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #fdfdfd
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af

title Third-party callback (request-type)\nAn external party calls us back on its own initiative; we prove it with a credential we keep, witness it, and merge

actor "Third-party\n(e.g. OAuth provider)" as TP
participant "Gate\n(facade)" as Gate
participant "UniversalNavigator\n(SharedServices)" as UN
participant "callback tool\n(route subscriber)" as Tool
participant "UniversalNavigatorProxy\n(satellite)" as PXY

TP -> Gate : inbound callback\nHTTP head + POST/GET params (no session token)
note over Gate : Dumb transport: collects head + params,\nstreams the answer back.\nVerifies nothing, owns no route.
Gate -> UN : hand over head + params

note over UN : TRIAGE by declared proof.\nNo session_token, no our_signature;\nthe named route's proof.method = api_key\n=> call_type third_party_callback

UN -> UN : read live registry: resolve the route\nand its proof.credential_name
note right of UN : api_key is a credential WE KEEP:\nresolved by vault name, never in the clear\n(same custody as OAuth)
UN -> UN : witness: verify the carried credential\nagainst the kept one

alt witness fails
  UN --> Gate : refuse (instrumented, with timings)
  Gate --> TP : reject
else witnessed
  note over UN : Determine the page this callback constructs;\nrecord its required_members as render-ledger expectations
  UN -> Tool : dispatch on the third_party_callback route\n(dispatch signed out: our_signature)
  Tool -> TP : exchange the code using the kept credential (outbound)
  TP --> Tool : tokens / profile
  Tool --> PXY : return document (our_signature attached)
  PXY -> Gate : POST across the wire\nroute tool_completion, call_type internal_callback
  Gate -> UN : pass(head, params, signature)
  note over UN : verify our_signature;\nclose this member's render-ledger entry
  UN -> UN : merge the returning document serially\n(shared deterministic merge)

  alt merge conflict
    UN -> UN : on_conflict = raise\nChatHealthyException, classified + instrumented
  else a required member dies / never returns
    UN -> UN : on_missing_required = raise\ninstrumented, timings at a severity matching impact
  else render budget expires first
    UN --> Gate : respond anyway with the layman on_timeout explanation
  else required members closed within budget
    UN -> UN : reconcile the page
    UN --> Gate : witnessed + merged result
  end
  Gate --> TP : acknowledge
end

note over Gate, UN : Later (infrastructure migration): this route couples with mTLS — out of this refactor
@enduml
